				<Content>of participants, including career changers, school-leavers and those seeking to re-enter the workforce. </Content>
				<Br />
				<Content>Thanks to a partnership with Box Hill Institute, 
the mandatory stable employee units of the 
program were again offered as electives within 
the Certificate III in Equine Studies. In FY25, more than 80 senior secondary students completed these units, supported by RV’s Workforce Development Team using retired thoroughbreds for practical assessments.</Content>
